Kudos and thanks to all, this is a great list.

Summary:

Check the variable auto_action (console action following an
error, halt or power-up): It can be halt, boot or restart
and the variable boot_osflags
 i=interactive boot,
 s=boot to single user
 a=autoboot to multiuser

e.g.
do shutdown -h 
to get the firmware prompt (>>>) 
>>> show boot_osflags
>>> set auto_action boot
>>> set boot_osflags a


